1,"army":0,"x":3,"y":19},{"type":24,"army":1,"x":32,"y":19},{"type":0,"army":0,"x":4,"y":21},{"type":23,"army":1,"x":32,"y":21},{"type":52,"army":1,"x":35,"y":21,"cargo":[2,3]},{"type":43,"army":1,"x":40,"y":21},{"type":8,"army":0,"x":1,"y":23},{"type":9,"army":0,"x":7,"y":24},{"type":39,"army":1,"x":42,"y":24},{"type":3,"army":0,"x":4,"y":25},{"type":2,"army":1,"x":33,"y":25},{"type":14,"army":1,"x":36,"y":26},{"type":15,"army":0,"x":2,"y":27},{"type":49,"army":1,"x":39,"y":27},{"type":40,"army":0,"x":2,"y":29},{"type":3,"army":1,"x":34,"y":29}],"arrivals":[{"turn":4,"army":0,"units":[{"type":58,"x":3,"y":1},{"type":39,"x":5,"y":1},{"type":39,"x":1,"y":2}]},{"turn":6,"army":1,"units":[{"type":42,"x":59,"y":6},{"type":31,"x":59,"y":15},{"type":49,"x":58,"y":4},{"type":49,"x":58,"y":26},{"type":51,"x":59,"y":24}]}],"objective":{"kind":"fortress"},"general":{"x":3,"y":15},"turnLimit":22,"cap":16,"music":7,"briefing":"High Earth orbit. The Directorate's Gate.\n\nKessrin built it during the war, to stop a Galt fleet that never came this far: a wall across the approach to Earth, three gates, a turret railway behind it, and the Carthago fortress in its own compound at the back of the yard. Everything that reaches Earth orbit from the high stations passes under its guns.\n\nWe have to go through it. Nothing else gets us to Olympos.\n\nThe north gate sits at the end of a magnetic river; the Dragons' beams are useless inside it. The centre gate is mined. The yard holds two Abaddons, and Ruess says their missiles do not explode so much as erase.\n\nCaptain Sato is coming around the north with the Selene Kai. The Directorate's reserve is three days behind her. Destroy the Carthago, and the Gate is ours.","goal":"Destroy the Carthago fortress within 22 turns. If the general falls, it is over.","routes":[{"prio":1,"x":33,"y":6},{"prio":1,"x":33,"y":14},{"prio":1,"x":34,"y":15},{"prio":1,"x":33,"y":24},{"prio":1,"x":36,"y":8},{"prio":1,"x":36,"y":22},{"prio":1,"x":38,"y":12},{"prio":1,"x":38,"y":18},{"prio":1,"x":42,"y":15},{"prio":1,"x":44,"y":9},{"prio":1,"x":44,"y":21}],"guards":3,"chapter":"Chapter 8 · The Gate, high Earth orbit","transmission":"Every road home runs through my Gate, General. I built it for the Galt fleet. It will serve just as well for you.","strategy":["Send the mecha and fighters up the magnetic corridor to the north gate: the Dragon turrets' beams can't touch a unit inside the field.","The centre gate is mined and covered by both Hydras. Don't force it; let artillery clear the mines from the asteroids to the south-west.","The two Abaddons in the yard fire Quantum Decimators at any capital ship in range. Keep the Selene and the cruisers out of reach until fighters have sunk them.","Captain Sato's Selene Kai and two cruisers arrive in the north-west on turn 5. Join them to the north gate push.","The Directorate reserve comes in from the east on turn 7. Be through the gate and at the compound's west opening by then: only the Carthago matters."],"plan":[{"n":1,"path":[[6,5],[17,5],[27,5],[33,6]]},{"n":2,"at":[14,22],"note":"artillery cover"},{"n":2,"path":[[17,21],[24,17],[27,15]]},{"n":3,"at":[40,9],"note":"Decimator"},{"n":3,"at":[40,21],"note":"Decimator"},{"n":4,"at":[4,1],"note":"Sato T5"},{"n":5,"path":[[34,6],[40,12],[46,15]]},{"n":5,"at":[58,15],"note":"Reserve T7"}],"comms":[{"speaker":"kessrin","text":"Every road home runs through my Gate, General. I built it for the Galt fleet. It will serve just as well for you."},{"speaker":"sato","text":"The north corridor is a magnetic river. Their Dragon turrets are beam weapons. You see where I'm going."},{"speaker":"ruess","text":"Those two Abaddons in the yard carry Quantum Decimators. Anything bigger than a fighter that comes within four hexes of them stops existing. Keep the carriers back."},{"speaker":"sato","text":"I'm bringing the Selene Kai and two cruisers around the north. Give me five days and an open gate."},{"speaker":"vane","text":"I'll be watching from the comet, General. Try not to die before I get my turn."}]}